thp-file-restore

From: Victor Araújo <victor@victor-software-house.com>

Downstream-Reason: Map snapshot file holes anonymously so a File restore with huge_pages Transparent gets transparent huge pages. Backport of upstream PR 6396 (commit a8e98e79): a private file mapping is never backed by THP, so each 2 MiB-aligned run of holes in the memory file is mapped anonymously and advised MADV_HUGEPAGE; data pages stay file-backed.
Upstream-Status: submitted upstream (PR 6396)
Drop-When: The fork moves to a Firecracker release that contains PR 6396.
